"https://imgur.com/pcmP0xG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\"><br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VYJzkYE.png\" width=\"51\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sKvQO1d.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「無附魔等級上限」移除了 Minecraft 開發者設定的附魔等級限制，原本的上限 255 現在提高到 2147483647（整數上限），你也可以使用負數等級，例如 -1、-100、-10000000。現在你可以使用新指令 /setenchant 在任何物品上附加任何附魔，請查看 Wiki 了解如何使用。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xAPPVoI.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/eIRCTYW.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\"></p><p><em><strong>常見問題</strong></em><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：我可以將「無附魔等級上限」加入我的模組包嗎？</strong><br>答：當然可以，只需在相關專案中放入我的模組即可。</span></p><p><strong>問：/setenchant 指令對非管理員玩家有效嗎？</strong><br>答：不行，你需要擁有管理員權限才能使用該指令。</p>",
